---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="What data Ruta y Ritmo processes, why it is used and how to exercise your rights."
  crumb="Privacy"
>
  <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 20 October 2026.</p>

  <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
  <p>
    The controller of this site is the Ruta y Ritmo editorial project, with a contact
    address in Madrid (Spain) and email{' '}
    <a href="mailto:hola@rutayritmo.com">hola@rutayritmo.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What data is processed</h2>
  <p>
    Ruta y Ritmo has no contact forms or newsletter and does not collect personal data
    through forms.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Technical server data:</strong> IP address, browser and requested pages,
      kept by the hosting provider for security and operating purposes.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Analytics:</strong> aggregated, cookieless visit measurements provided by
      Vercel Web Analytics. They are used to understand which pages are read and do not
      create personal profiles.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Advertising:</strong> if you accept ads, Google and its partners may use
      identifiers and cookies to measure and personalize advertising.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why it is used</h2>
  <p>
    To keep the site secure, understand its audience in aggregate and, only with your
    consent, show ads. It is not used to build our own commercial profiles and is not
    sold to third parties.
  </p>

  <h2>Legal basis</h2>
  <p>
    Personalized advertising is based on your consent, which you can withdraw at any
    time. Technical data is processed on the basis of legitimate interest in the security
    of the service. Aggregated analytics is designed not to identify individual users.
  </p>

  <h2>How long it is kept</h2>
  <p>
    Technical hosting logs follow the hosting provider's own retention periods. Your
    cookie choice is stored in your browser until you clear the site's data.
  </p>

  <h2>Recipients and processors</h2>
  <p>
    The site is hosted by a static hosting provider and uses Vercel Web Analytics. If ads
    are enabled, Google Ireland Limited acts as the advertising provider. These providers
    may process data outside the European Economic Area under standard contractual
    clauses or other legal safeguards.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can read Google's privacy policy at{' '}
    <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can request access, rectification, erasure, objection, restriction and
    portability of your data by writing to{' '}
    <a href="mailto:hola@rutayritmo.com">hola@rutayritmo.com</a>. You can also file a
    complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency
    (<a href="https://www.aepd.es/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aepd.es</a>).
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>
    Details of cookies and local storage are in the{' '}
    <a href="/en/cookies/">cookie policy</a>. If you accept ads, Google may use cookies to
    show advertising based on your visits to this and other sites. You can turn off
    personalization at{' '}
    <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">google.com/settings/ads</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Minors</h2>
  <p>
    The site is not aimed at children under 14 and does not knowingly collect data from
    minors.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    This policy may be updated if the services or the law change. The date of the last
    review appears at the top.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
